    </div>
    <div id="p-0158" num="0187" class="description-paragraph">Explanation of symbols in Formula 2:
</div> <ul> <li id="ul0012-0001" num="0000"> <ul> <li id="ul0013-0001" num="0188">I (φ): Integrated intensity in range of 19.5°&lt;2θ&lt;21.3° for declination angle (p after background correction and empty cell scattering correction φ: Declination angle (rad)</li> </ul> </li> </ul>

    <div id="p-0159" num="0189" class="description-paragraph">
      <maths id="MATH-US-00008" num="00008">
        <math overflow="scroll">
          <mtable>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <mrow>
                  <mi>f</mi>
